<title>PHILIPPINES: Cosmos up 5.9 pct on higher '96 net talk.</title>
<headline>Cosmos up 5.9 pct on higher '96 net talk.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cosmos Bottling Corp gained 40 centavos, or 7.27 percent, to 5.90 pesos a share in early trade on talk of a higher 1996 full year net income, brokers said.</p>
</text>
